                "com_touch_fingers_6": "$self$'s world was frozen; no matter what shameful shapes her fingers were bent into, her expression remained stuck in the previous second.",
                "com_touch_fingers_7": "$self$ was like an exquisite doll, insensate as $target$'s fingers wandered over and rubbed her fingertips.",
                "com_touch_fingers_8": "The tactile sensation on her fingertips couldn't reach her brain; $self$ simply stood frozen in time, a plaything in $target$'s hands.",
